001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.     TINVHLD.
001300 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER/ANNETTE TREUDLER.
001400 INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
001500 DATE-WRITTEN.   MARCH 1985.
001800*REMARKS.
001900*         INVOICES ON HOLD REPORT.
002000*
002100***************************************************************
002200***************************************************************
002300***                   I N V H L D                           ***
002400***                                                         ***
002500***      THIS PROGRAM PRINTS ALL INVOICES ON HOLD.  IT      ***
002600***      SHOWS INVOICE, FREIGHT, ITEM, AND ACCOUNTING       ***
002700***      DATA BY REGISTER NUMBER.  THE REPORT IS SORTED     ***
002800***      BY OLDEST DUE DATE OR BY REGISTER NUMBER.          ***
002900***                                                         ***
003000***     THE REPORT IS PRINTED TO A DISC FILE.  THE JOB      ***
003100***     STREAM THAT RUNS THIS PROGRAM SETS THE SPOOLER      ***
003200***     TYPE AND PRINTER NUMBER AND THEN RUNS A PROGRAM     ***
003300***     CALLED "XPRTRPT".  THIS IS DONE SO THAT EACH        ***
003400***     PLANT MAY HAVE THEIR OWN JOB STREAM AND CAN         ***
003500***     ASSIGN THE REPORT TO ANY PRINTER THEY WISH.         ***
003600***     "XPRTRPT" ALSO HAS THE ABILITY TO COMPRESS THE      ***
003700***     132 CHARACTER REPORT TO FIT ON AN 80-COLUMN PRINTER.***
003800***                                                         ***
003900***************************************************************
004000*   CALLING PROGRAM:    TRSCREEN                              *
004100***************************************************************
004110
004120****************************************************************
004130*
004140*                        C H A N G E S
004150*
004160* JULY 31, 1985  ADDED A SORT OPTION TO ALLOW THE USER TO SORT
004170* THE REPORT BY DATE OR REGISTER NUMBER.   DALE HOERLE
      *
      *C  JUNE 23, 1994   CR KALMAN
      *C   ADDED CALL TO COBOL ERROR HANDLER -MCXCBLERR.
      *C
      *C  JULY 15, 1996   CA YODER
      *C   MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
004180****************************************************************
004300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
004400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
004500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
004600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.    C01 IS NEW-PAGE.

004700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
004800 FILE-CONTROL.
004900     SELECT DISC-PRT           ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
005000     SELECT HOLD-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-INVSRT.
005100     SELECT SORT-FILE          ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
           SELECT DINVRCD-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DPOFREIGHT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2404
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVITM-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2601
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DINVACCT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DVENDOR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                    WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

