066200     MOVE INV-STATUS            TO LINE1-STATUS.
066300     MOVE INV-DATE              TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
066400     MOVE 4                     TO DATE-MODE.
066500     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
066600     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT        TO LINE1-INV-DATE.
066700     MOVE INV-ENTRY-DATE        TO DATE-VALIDATE-IN.
066800     MOVE 4                     TO DATE-MODE.
066900     CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
067000     MOVE DATE-SLASH-OUT        TO LINE1-ENTRY-DATE.
