076500     MOVE " CE 4 (INSURANCE) "  TO LINE5-CE4.
076600     MOVE CE4-INS               TO LINE5-AMT.
076700     ADD CE4-INS TO G-CE-4-TOTAL, GRAND-TOTAL.
076800     MOVE " ACCRUED TAX   "     TO LINE5-TAX.
